PRES 25P1      -1.00   ! patch to convert a 3'-5' phosphodiester
                       ! linkage to a 2'-5' in deoxy species
                       ! for PYRIMIDINES due to N1/N9 conflict
                       ! Note: groups from this patch are NOT correct
DELE ATOM 1O3'
